g=A.tw("https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.capital.cbt",A.c(["Feature-first Flutter modules","Secure storage and biometric access","Reusable banking service integrations","CI/CD-aware release process"],h),B.iB,"Support high-risk daily banking flows across accounts, cards, transfers, bill payments, CliQ, biometrics, loyalty, and customer self-service without weakening reliability or release control.","Capital Bank Mobile is a secure digital banking application designed to simplify daily banking activities through a modern mobile experience.\n\nThe app supports account management, transfers, card services, bill payments, instant CliQ transfers, biometric access, loyalty management, and cardless cash withdrawal flows.\n\nKey features:\n\u2022 Account dashboard with balances and transaction overview.\n\u2022 Beneficiary management for faster transfers.\n\u2022 Local and international money transfers.\n\u2022 eFAWATEERcom bill payments.\n\u2022 Instant transfers using CliQ.\n\u2022 Credit card management and installment payments.\n\u2022 Profile, biometrics, contact number, loyalty points, and cardless cash management.\n\u2022 Secure communication with the bank support team.","capital_bank","assets/images/projects/capitalbank.webp","Helped deliver a production banking channel that moves common branch and support workflows into mobile self-service.","https://apps.apple.com/jo/app/capital-bank-mobile-jordan/id1630681705",!0,B.cH,p,f,"Mobile architecture and delivery lead",g,"A secure digital banking app for daily banking, transfers, cards, bill payments, CliQ, and customer self-service.","Organized the mobile work around secure feature modules, reusable banking integrations, controlled QA cycles, and store-ready Android/iOS delivery.",p,B.a_W,"Capital Bank Mobile \u2013 Jordan","https://capitalbank.jo/")
